{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SkateNationXL</strong> is an <i>indie arcade skateboarding</i> game that pays tribute to the <i>classics</i> of the genre. Set in a world <i>inspired by real-life  spots</i>, it invites players to  skate, and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/TheWarehouse_R18__1_.png?t=1744637317\" /><strong>Customize your experience</strong> by creating a <i>unique skater</i> and <i>board setup</i>. Choose your outfit, gear, and deck to stand out both offline and online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/Harbor_01.png?t=1744637317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join dedicated servers to skate with others in real time, or hop into player-hosted sessions to hang out  together.</strong> <strong>Lobby Mode</strong> offers a <i>relaxed space</i> to meet up with friends and cruise at your own pace, while <strong>Showdown</strong> brings the competition in a fast-paced mode for up to <i>8 players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/TheWarehouse_R9.png?t=1744637317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SkateNationXL\u00a0</strong>It\u2019s a <i>modern tribute</i> to  <strong>classic arcade skateboarding</strong> <strong>games</strong>\u2014blending familiar vibes with today\u2019s tools and online play. Whether you're chasing high scores, unlocking new gear, or just cruising with friends, <i>SkateNationXL</i> gives you the freedom to skate your way. Drop in, express yourself, and leave your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/Harbor_02__1_.png?t=1744637317\" /></p>","background":"https://store.a